              "segment": {
                "start_index": 605,
                "end_index": 807,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "This calculation is based on the following:\n* **The math:** $15\\text{ blinks/minute} \\times 1,440\\text{ minutes/day} \\times 365\\text{ days/year} \\times 80\\text{ years} \\approx 630\\text{ million blinks}$"
