              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1737,
                "end_index": 1971,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "#### **High-End Estimate (20 blinks per minute)**\n* **Per day:** $20\\text{ blinks} \\times 960\\text{ waking minutes} = 19,200\\text{ blinks/day}$\n* **Per year:** $19,200 \\times 365.25\\text{ days} \\approx 7.01\\text{ million blinks/year}$"
